# Derived Kaggle data: regenerate with `python tools/prepare_data.py`. Not committed because
# Otto is a Kaggle *competition* dataset governed by competition rules, not an open licence —
# republishing it (or a slice of it) in a public repo would very likely violate the T&Cs, which
# is exactly why Kaggle requires per-user rules acceptance. data/MANIFEST.sha256 IS committed
# and is the reproducibility contract.
data/*.csv
data/*.zip

# The private ground truth. Handed to Macrocosmos for upload to R2; never committed, never
# baked into an image. Its sha256 is pinned in spec.yaml and env/labels.py.
private/

# Generated submissions from tools/make_test_submission.py
build/
